{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/10006-old-forum-s-last-rites","id":10006,"title":"Old Forum's Last Rites","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-13T15:01:28-08:00","id":10006,"title":"Old Forum's Last Rites","content":"I was thinking today about how engaging and generally awesome this forum's previous incarnation was (and still is for a few months!) and thought it would be prudent to make a thread where we share some of our favorite memories. Here's mine.<br /> <br /> The last time the forum shut down for an extended period due to maintenance, I started a fun thread where I answered questions as my favorite Primordial from Exalted: Mardukth, Who Holds in Thrall. It mostly involved silly exchanges where I in turn would ask them if they were sure I was the entity they were looking for, since Mardukth was so vast and huge that even he could hardly believe it.<br /> <br /> I monitored the thread closely as it was pretty fun exercise. Mere hours before the forums shuttered closed for a month, though, a brand new user appeared and started asking me questions. They would also answer questions, including ones they posed, in addition to my own responses.<br /> <br /> The account name? Mardukth. And yes, we had a philosophical discussion with ourself, because Mardukth is so vast he very well could have talked to himself or had lesser souls exist to tell him who he is, lest he forget.<br /> <br /> When the forums came back up a month later, the account had disappeared. I thought this was one of the coolest (and eeriest) internet interactions I've ever had. Kudos to whichever one of you cooked up a throwaway just for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T22:30:23-08:00","id":10213,"title":"","content":"My favorite forum incident is actually from the old black and green forum prior to 2003. A forumite named Arbenghast had another person using the account but didn't say that it was being done. So you had in some places Arby was saying he was a she and other that he was a he. Arby was banned by Conrad and he later returned as someone else whose initials are Elisa Thaliman, or something like that. The whole thing was hilarious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1090-tobias","name":"Tobias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1090_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T22:35:19-08:00","id":10220,"title":"","content":"&quot;Can Vegans Swallow?&quot; Best (funniest) thread ever, from either '04 or '05. It would probably get shut down pretty quickly now because it had something to offend everyone in it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T00:42:12-08:00","id":10252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/10006-old-forum-s-last-rites?p=10220#post10220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Can Vegans Swallow?&quot; Best (funniest) thread ever, from either '04 or '05. It would probably get shut down pretty quickly now because it had something to offend everyone in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have asked a vegan that question and the response is indeed fantastic. I have also asked her if eating the coffee beans pooped out by the civet is vegan--and she said they are!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T05:15:00-08:00","id":10337,"title":"","content":"Hands down, my favorite memory of the forums is when a couple of forumites invited a handful of us to their wedding. I've told that story to near completion, though.<br /> <br /> A close runner up is the time Lord Bob explained to me that internet fights are not for the fighters, because that's pointless, but for the audience. It's an incredibly useful change of perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T14:45:54-08:00","id":10795,"title":"","content":"Someone once advertised for their roleplaying site, and posted a sample scene that was written in a way that H.P. Lovecraft would find needlessly Byzantine, full of words that even an English professor would need to look up in order to understand. Someone posted a long backhanded compliment using similar diction. Maybe it was one of those &quot;you had to be there&quot; moments, but I thought that it was an amazing response. Made my day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T15:51:43-08:00","id":10836,"title":"","content":"I remember when I started following the Ink Monkey blog posts and threads.<br /> I remember Holden hinted about Ex3 to me and it went absolutely over my head.<br /> I remember arguing endlessly with people on matters such as Lillun, Whether Kejak should be put on trial and why Infernals will never be as Metal as Abyssals.<br /> I remember the 1001 Exalted Songs thread, and all the weird music styles housed therein.<br /> I remember the Charity thread, where I was elected Hierarch of the Guild and won a Masters of Jade PDF.<br /> I remember Telgar and several Scion users raiding an Exalted thread about Negativity within Fandoms, The irony of the situation, still doubtlessly lost to them.<br /> I remember Mr. Gone and Demetrius. I remember the being happy to be moderated by the latter and the very last conversation I had with the former.<br /> I remember mourning the loss of the Thank system, dying a little inside every time I saw a &quot;Manual thank&quot; or &quot;1+&quot; and cursing everyone who took them from us.<br /> I remember dozens of names attached to people that I'll never talk to anyone else about, but think about and smile.<br /> <br /> I remember a lot. And I'm gonna miss all of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T14:24:14-08:00","id":11567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/10006-old-forum-s-last-rites?p=10836#post10836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember Mr. Gone and Demetrius. I remember the being happy to be moderated by the latter and the very last conversation I had with the former.<br /> I remember mourning the loss of the Thank system, dying a little inside every time I saw a &quot;Manual thank&quot; or &quot;1+&quot; and cursing everyone who took them from us.<br /> I remember dozens of names attached to people that I'll never talk to anyone else about, but think about and smile.<br /> <br /> I remember a lot. And I'm gonna miss all of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it was sad to see Demetrius go. At least we have a thank system that works now!<br /> <br /> And I too am going to be very confused about the new names for people. You, for example--I think you were once known as Chills &amp; One Last Joke? It's going to take me forever to reacquaint myself with the regulars now!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T09:17:55-08:00","id":12112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/10006-old-forum-s-last-rites?p=11567#post11567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I too am going to be very confused about the new names for people. You, for example--I think you were once known as Chills &amp; One Last Joke?</div> </div> </div> </div>Guilty as Charged, Part of the reason I still have an Atomsk avatar is to help with that. And because Atomsk is the shit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T17:24:56-08:00","id":12386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/10006-old-forum-s-last-rites?p=12112#post12112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Guilty as Charged, Part of the reason I still have an Atomsk avatar is to help with that. And because Atomsk is the shit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amen, brother-man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T17:55:46-08:00","id":12405,"title":"","content":"I remember when I first joined the old forums a few years ago, when I'd just gotten into the hobby. While I don't believe I've become any less insufferable (Unfortunately) I really did appreciate how willing people were to bat around ideas with me for my first horrific failure of a Chronicle. I've learned a bit since then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}